  "description": "The ultimate car dealership experience. Buy cars at auctions, restore them to their former glory, and sell them for a profit. Customize and expand your office to build the most prestigious car empire in the world!\n\n- Build Your Showroom.  \nStart from a simple office and transform it into a world-class car dealership. Take full control of your office: expand its size, choose unique layouts, and customize every detail to reflect your personal style. Your office isn't just a workplace—it’s a symbol of your success.\n\n- The Thrill of the Auction.  \nTravel to various auto auctions to find hidden gems and rare classics. Outbid your rivals and secure the best deals. Every car has a story, and it’s up to you to decide which ones are worth the investment.\n\n- Restore to Perfection.  \nGet your hands dirty in the workshop. Repair mechanical issues and give each vehicle a fresh look. A well-restored car isn't just a machine—it’s a masterpiece that will attract the most elite buyers.\n\n- Master the Market.  \nBuy low, sell high. Use your business intuition to negotiate with customers and maximize your profits. Manage your budget wisely to buy rarer cars and a grander office as you climb to the top of the industry.\n\n- Your Empire, Your Rules.  \nIn Car Sales Simulator 2026, you are the boss. Whether you prefer flipping quick city cars or collecting luxury exotics, the path to becoming the ultimate car mogul is entirely in your hands.",
